WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.220
For me, I've always been very comfortable
and confident in my identity.

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:05.960
I'm mixed -race, you know, I'm just as
much black as I am white.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.200
I'm part of the black community, I'm also
part of the white community,

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.340
but obviously we lean more to the black
side.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.380
But because in the UK, if you're not
white, you're seen as black.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:18.080
You know, you're still an icy female, you
still get stops in search,

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:21.280
you still get called the N -word, et
cetera, et cetera.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.420
But, so we've had very similar
experiences,

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:26.200
but I'm also aware that I'm a lighter
tone, a mixed -race.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:27.760
So I've always been very comfortable in
that.
